{"aliases":["醉翁亭记","欧阳修《醉翁亭记》"],"asset_ids":["cn.song.asset.zuiweng-pavilion.interpretation"],"category":"文章","exhibit_type":"historical_record","fact_card_ids":["cn.song.fact.zuiweng-pavilion.reference"],"id":"cn.song.artifact.zuiweng-pavilion","presentation":{"background_node_id":"cn.song.node.zuiweng-pavilion.intro","display":{"asset_id":"cn.song.asset.zuiweng-pavilion.interpretation","interpretation_label":"文章意境演绎，不是实地照片。","kind":"interpretive_image"},"preview_asset_id":"cn.song.asset.zuiweng-pavilion.interpretation","printed_text":{"body":"环滁皆山也。其西南诸峰，林壑尤美，望之蔚然而深秀者，琅琊也。","interpretation_label":"排印摘句，不是手迹。","script_status":"printed_not_handwriting","source_label":"传世文本现代排印，非作者手迹"},"teaser":"欧阳修在滁州时，写下了一座山中的小亭。文章里不只有山水，还有与他一同游玩的百姓。"},"source_ids":["cn.song.source.reference-zuiweng-pavilion"],"story_entry_ids":["cn.song.story.zuiweng-pavilion"],"time_range":{"display_label":"1045年前后","end_year":1046,"precision":"year","start_year":1045,"uncertainty":"文章场景属于文学描绘，不能逐一等同于记录镜头。"},"title":"欧阳修《醉翁亭记》"}